#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandEntrance_00311:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDENTRANCE_00311_SYSTEM_100_000:1"
msgid "Certain gear obtained during the course of an exploratory mission can be exchanged for <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>brass sky pirate spoils</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by speaking with spoils traders in Ishgard, the Diadem, or in any residential district."
msgstr ""

#. ja: また、「ディアデム諸島」で採集をしていると、<br>「スカイパイレーツスポイル：鋼鉄」を入手することがあります。
#. de: Beim Sammeln auf dem Diadem kannst du außerdem auf Stahl-Piratenandenken stoßen.
#. fr: Des espoilles en acier peuvent également être découvertes en effectuant des opérations de récolte au Diadème.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
